P1para.Text:
In section 20A(5) of the Health and Social Care Act 2008 (functions relating to processing of information by registered persons), in the definition of  “processing”, for  “the Data Protection Act 1998” substitute “
                  Parts 5 to 7 of the Data Protection Act 2018 (see section 3(4) and (14) of that Act);
                ”.

P4para.Text:
for  “controller or processor” there were substituted “
                                        trust service provider
                                      ”;

for  “the data protection legislation” there were substituted “
                                        the eIDAS Regulation and the EITSET Regulations
                                      ”;

P3para.Text:
subsections (3)(b) and (4)(b) have effect as if for  “the data protection legislation” there were substituted “
                                    the eIDAS Regulation or the EITSET Regulations
                                  ”;

subsection (7)(a) has effect as if for  “this Act” there were substituted “
                                    section 144 or 148 or paragraph 15 of Schedule 15
                                  ”;

P4para.Text:
for  “controller or processor” (in both places) there were substituted “
                                        trust service provider
                                      ”;

for  “the data protection legislation” there were substituted “
                                        the eIDAS requirements
                                      ”;

for  “as described in subsection (2), (3), (4) or (5)” there were substituted “
                                        to comply with the eIDAS requirements
                                      ”;

for  “sections 150 and 151” there were substituted “
                                        section 150
                                      ”;

P3para.Text:
in sub-paragraphs (1) and (2), for  “controller or processor” there were substituted “
                                    trust service provider
                                  ”;

in sub-paragraph (1)(c), for  “the processing of personal data” there were substituted “
                                    the provision of trust services
                                  ”;

P4para.Text:
for  “controller or processor” there were substituted “
                                        trust service provider
                                      ”;

for  “as described in section 149(2)” there were substituted “
                                        to comply with the eIDAS requirements
                                      ”;

for  “controller or processor” there were substituted “
                                        trust service provider
                                      ”;

P3para.Text:
for  “controller or processor”, in each place, there were substituted “
                                    trust services provider
                                  ”;

in paragraph (c), for  “data subjects” there were substituted “
                                    relying parties
                                  ”;

in subsection (1), for paragraphs (a) and (b) there were substituted “
                                the exercise of the rights of appeal conferred by section 162
                              ”;
